# Environment variables are configured per workspace. Copy the matching file:
#   apps/web/.env.example            -> apps/web/.env.local           (Business Suite, Next.js)
#   apps/mobile/.env.example         -> apps/mobile/.env              (Sodia, Expo)
#   supabase/functions/.env.example  -> supabase/functions/.env       (edge function secrets; `supabase secrets set` in prod)
# Never commit real values. Only anon/publishable keys may use NEXT_PUBLIC_ / EXPO_PUBLIC_.
